OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F305A1786376898
OL,3,CGianni Infantino era 'is over', says
OL,4,CLaLiga boss as pressure mounts on Fifa
OL,5,Chead
OL,7,FThe president of Spain's top football
OL,8,Fleague, Javier Tebas, has said Gianni
OL,9,FInfantino is "destroying the very
OL,10,Fessence" of football and believes his
OL,11,Ftime as Fifa president has come to an
OL,12,Fend.
OL,14,FInfantino has faced criticism
OL,15,Ffollowing his failed plan to seek
OL,16,Fprivate investment in a company which
OL,17,Fwould run Fifa's competitions and sell
OL,18,Fstakes in the World Cup to private
OL,19,Finvestors.
OL,26,@qD@NOUrD@HO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
