OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,306,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F305A1786376898
OL,3,CGianni Infantino era 'is over', says
OL,4,CLaLiga boss as pressure mounts on Fifa
OL,5,Chead
OL,7,FAfter fierce backlash, including a
OL,8,Fthreat by Europe's Uefa to boycott the
OL,9,FWorld Cup, Fifa then revealed it "will
OL,10,Fnot proceed" with the plans.
OL,12,FOn Wednesday Infantino apologised to
OL,13,Fnational associations over how the
OL,14,Fplan was developed, but several
OL,15,Fassociations including Uefa, and Wales
OL,16,Fand England's football associations,
OL,17,Fhave called on Infantino to resign.
OL,26,@qD@bOUrD@LO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,306,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F305A1786376898
OL,3,CGianni Infantino era 'is over', says
OL,4,CLaLiga boss as pressure mounts on Fifa
OL,5,Chead
OL,7,FTebas, who has been president of
OL,8,FLaLiga since 2013, is the latest
OL,9,Fperson to call for the Fifa president
OL,10,Fto resign and thinks his position has
OL,11,Fnow become untenable.
OL,13,FSpeaking to Le Monde, he said: "For
OL,14,Fme, Gianni Infantino's time has long
OL,15,Fsince passed.
OL,17,F"I'm not saying this because of recent
OL,18,Fevents; I have noticed this style of
OL,19,Fmanagement for a long time, though
OL,20,Feveryone else seems to be discovering
OL,21,Fit only now.
OL,26,@uD@`OUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,306,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F305A1786376898
OL,3,CGianni Infantino era 'is over', says
OL,4,CLaLiga boss as pressure mounts on Fifa
OL,5,Chead
OL,7,F"Gianni Infantino is not someone who
OL,8,Fcontributes to the growth of football.
OL,9,FOn the contrary, his projects are
OL,10,Fdestroying the very essence of the
OL,11,Fsport: the national leagues.
OL,13,F"Football is not limited to the elite.
OL,14,FFor me, the Infantino era is over.
OL,15,FWhat remains to be seen is when that
OL,16,Fwill take effect and how the
OL,17,Fsuccession will unfold.
OL,19,F"I hope it is not just a matter of
OL,20,Fswapping out some people for others,
OL,21,Fbut of a genuine overhaul."
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@AOU{D@AOU}D@[O]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,306,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F305A1786376898
OL,3,CGianni Infantino era 'is over', says
OL,4,CLaLiga boss as pressure mounts on Fifa
OL,5,Chead
OL,7,FThe pressure notched higher this week
OL,8,Fwhen Uefa said a "departure payment"
OL,9,Fwas made to a female employee who is
OL,10,Falleged to have been in a relationship
OL,11,Fwith Infantino while he was general
OL,12,Fsecretary of the organisation `
OL,13,FInfantino denied the claims.
OL,15,FFifa hit out at Infantino's critics
OL,16,Fand accused them of trying weaken his
OL,17,Fauthority so he is removed from his
OL,18,Frole without a due re-election
OL,19,Fprocess, while Mexico and Argentina's
OL,20,Fassociations have come out in support
OL,21,Fof him.
OL,26,@pD@ROUpD@dO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,306,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F305A1786376898
OL,3,CGianni Infantino era 'is over', says
OL,4,CLaLiga boss as pressure mounts on Fifa
OL,5,Chead
OL,7,FA European threat to boycott the World
OL,8,FCup remains in place despite
OL,9,FInfantino's apology, with Tebas
OL,10,Fadding: "What is happening does not
OL,11,Fsurprise me. What does surprise me is
OL,12,Fthe reaction of many people who
OL,13,Fremained silent for years.
OL,15,F"This episode is only the tip of the
OL,16,Ficeberg of what has been going on
OL,17,Fwithin an institution, Fifa, but also
OL,18,Fmore broadly in football, where there
OL,19,Fare no real governance policies. And
OL,20,Fthe problem is not limited to one
OL,21,Fperson; it is about an entire system.
OL,26,@rD@IOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,306,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F305A1786376898
OL,3,CGianni Infantino era 'is over', says
OL,4,CLaLiga boss as pressure mounts on Fifa
OL,5,Chead
OL,7,F"The old system can persist even when
OL,8,Fthe people change. Let's hope things
OL,9,Ftruly change, that a new leader
OL,10,Farrives, and that new governance is
OL,11,Festablished at Fifa."
OL,13,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,14,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,15,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,16,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@UO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,306,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F305A1786376898
OL,3,CGianni Infantino era 'is over', says
OL,4,CLaLiga boss as pressure mounts on Fifa
OL,5,Chead
OL,7,FIn a statement shared by Fifa on
OL,8,FSaturday night, the global football
OL,9,Fassociation said: "Fifa will not
OL,10,Fsupport, facilitate or tolerate any
OL,11,Fprocess concerning the election of the
OL,12,FFIFA president that is inconsistent
OL,13,Fwith Fifa's statutes, democratic
OL,14,Fprocedures and established governance
OL,15,Fframework.
OL,17,F"The Fifa president was democratically
OL,18,Felected by Fifa's member associations
OL,19,Fand continues to serve with their
OL,20,Fmandate."
OL,26,@qD@SOUyD@AOU|D@IO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G8/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,306,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F305A1786376898
OL,3,CGianni Infantino era 'is over', says
OL,4,CLaLiga boss as pressure mounts on Fifa
OL,5,Chead
OL,7,FIn a thinly veiled attack on Uefa,
OL,8,FFifa added: "It is increasingly
OL,9,Fevident that there is a concerted and
OL,10,Fongoing effort by some to undermine
OL,11,FFifa and its president.
OL,13,F"Those who do not have the support of
OL,14,FFifa's member associations should not
OL,15,Fseek to achieve through allegation,
OL,16,Finsinuation or misinformation what
OL,17,Fthey cannot achieve through Fifa's
OL,18,Festablished democratic processes."
OL,26,@pD@MOUuD@AOUzD@bO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G9/9
